1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
One temple shaped half of kung fu.
半部功夫史，出自一座寺

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,300
Shaolin — founded in 495 AD.
少林寺，公元495年建

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,600
At the foot of Mount Song, in Henan.
就在河南嵩山脚下

5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,000
A monk, Bodhidharma, sat facing a wall.
达摩在此面壁修禅

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,400
He founded Chan — the Zen you know.
他开创禅宗，就是"禅"

7
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,800
Meditation was brutal, so monks trained kung fu.
坐禅太苦，便习武强身

8
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,200
中! Double-tap if you'd train here at dawn.
中！想来练早功的，点个赞

9
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,600
A UNESCO site, 1,500 years alive.
世遗古寺，活了一千五百年

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,400
★ Expert Tip: Come before 8am — catch the warrior-monk demo before the crowds.
内行提示：8点前到，看武僧晨演避人潮

11
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,600
Zen or kung fu — which would you come for?
你为禅而来，还是为功夫？
